# air packages this dir as a tar snapshot and applies .gitignore as tar-exclude
# rules (see CLAUDE.md). Keep macOS/editor/Python junk OUT of the snapshot so the
# worker's code_source is exactly the project tree. In particular, macOS xattr
# metadata can materialise as `._*` AppleDouble entries on the Linux worker and
# hijack $CODE_SOURCE_PATH — exclude them explicitly.
._*
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
_prep_out/
